## Ping-dot
- Rename to StatusDot
- Add hover-over text to the status-dot (Online/Unreachable)
- Add a status for "warning" showing if the host is online but has a slow ping response (maybe >100ms?), or if one of the connection methods (dns/ip) is unreachable but the other is online.
- In host creation, add a port checker that checks if the port is open on the remote host.
- Add an orange dot if the failover is used (ex if hostname is primary and unreachable but IP is ok, or if the port is closed but the IP/host is reachable)
- Add option to disable ping feature - also disables ping in host creation/edit
- Add support for paths in IP/domains for web hosts.
- - maybe there should be a two-part ping, where it pings the raw host and then uses some other way to scan if the website path returns a valid response


