## Sync
Some way to sync the connection entries, maybe to a git repo.
- So that the Remote Routes app ships with an integrated git client
- Can both pull and push from a repo
- That way users can store their connections in a private repo on ex Github.
- Maybe omit the password field, and when a user imports a bunch of connections, it would ask for the password on the first connection, and ask if they want to save it to the local database.
- - in other words, passwords are not synced.


